      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "**繁體中文**\n\n全新安裝沒有模型檔，這支「文生音樂」範本需要以下 2 個檔案：\n\n- `ace_step_1.5_turbo_aio.safetensors` → 放到 `ComfyUI/models/checkpoints/` → 10.03 GB\n  官方載點：https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/ACE-Step-1.5/resolve/main/checkpoints/ace_step_1.5_turbo_aio.safetensors\n  （ACE-Step 1.5 turbo 的 all-in-one 檔，主模型＋文字編碼器＋VAE 三合一，MIT 授權。）\n- `qwen3-vl-4b-heretic.safetensors` → 放到 `ComfyUI/models/text_encoders/` → 8.27 GB\n  官方載點：https://huggingface.co/DreamFast/Qwen3-VL-4b-Heretic-ComfyUI/resolve/main/qwen3-vl-4b-heretic.safetensors\n  （「想法 → 英文風格描述」小幫手用的無審查編碼器，和其他範本共用，裝過就不用再抓；平台目前沒有這兩顆的備份鏡像，請走官方載點。）\n\n共約 18.3 GB。\n放好檔案後**不用重啟 ComfyUI 或 worker**：ComfyFed agent 每 10 分鐘自動重掃模型庫存並回報平台，評估會自動轉綠；急著馬上生效的話，手動重啟 agent 即可。\n\n---\n\n**English**\n\nA fresh install has none of these files. The text-to-music template needs 2 files:\n\n- `ace_step_1.5_turbo_aio.safetensors` -> `ComfyUI/models/checkpoints/` -> 10.03 GB\n  官方載點：https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/ACE-Step-1.5/resolve/main/checkpoints/ace_step_1.5_turbo_aio.safetensors\n  (The ACE-Step 1.5 turbo all-in-one checkpoint — diffusion model, text encoder and VAE in one file. MIT license.)\n- `qwen3-vl-4b-heretic.safetensors` -> `ComfyUI/models/text_encoders/` -> 8.27 GB\n  官方載點：https://huggingface.co/DreamFast/Qwen3-VL-4b-Heretic-ComfyUI/resolve/main/qwen3-vl-4b-heretic.safetensors\n  (The uncensored prompt-helper encoder, shared with the other idea-box templates. No ComfyFed mirror for these yet, so use the official links.)\n\nAbout 18.3 GB in total. After placing the files there is **no need to restart ComfyUI or the worker** — the agent rescans its model inventory every 10 minutes; restart the agent manually if you need it picked up right away."
      ],
      "title": "⓪ 缺模型？/ Missing models?"
    },
