      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "# 文生音樂（ACE-Step 1.5）＋ 中文想法直接生\n\n打一段**中文**（或英文）的音樂想法，就生出一首帶人聲的完整歌曲。\n紅框有三顆：**音樂想法**（曲風、氛圍、樂器、人聲，交給 AI 翻成英文風格描述）、**歌詞**（直接寫中文歌詞，留 `[Verse]`、`[Chorus]` 這類段落標記）、**歌曲長度**（秒）。\n模型是 **ACE-Step 1.5 turbo**（ACE Studio × StepFun 2026-01 開源，MIT 授權，8 步即可出歌，支援中文在內的多國語言人聲）。\n\n**怎麼用：**\n1. 改紅框「音樂想法」：一句話寫清楚曲風、氛圍、樂器、人聲類型。\n2. 改紅框「歌詞」：中文可以直接寫；想要純伴奏就把歌詞清空只留 `[Intro]`。\n3. 需要別的語言：把 `TextEncodeAceStepAudio1.5` 的 `language` 從 `zh` 改掉（例如 `en`、`ja`）。\n4. 按右上角 Run；跑完的歌出現在最右邊的節點，可以直接試聽、下載。\n\n---\n\n# Text-to-music (ACE-Step 1.5) with a Chinese idea box\n\nThree red nodes: the **music idea** (genre, mood, instruments, vocals — a local AI rewrites it into English style tags), the **lyrics** (Chinese works as-is; keep section markers like `[Verse]`/`[Chorus]`; clear them for an instrumental), and the **song length** in seconds. The model is **ACE-Step 1.5 turbo** (ACE Studio × StepFun, MIT license, 8-step turbo, multilingual vocals including Chinese). Change the `language` widget on `TextEncodeAceStepAudio1.5` (default `zh`) when the lyrics are in another language."
      ],
      "title": "這是什麼範本 / What this template is"
    },
    {
      "id": 101,
      "type": "MarkdownNote",
      "pos": [
        -20,
        440
      ],
      "size": [
        520,
        420
      ],
      "flags": {},
      "order": 19,
      "mode": 0,
      "inputs": [],
      "outputs": [],
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "**繁體中文**\n\n這一區是「模型載入器」：\n\n- `CheckpointLoaderSimple` — ACE-Step 1.5 turbo 的 **all-in-one** 檔（`ace_step_1.5_turbo_aio`，10.03 GB），主模型、文字編碼器、VAE 三合一，一個檔案就夠。\n- `ModelSamplingAuraFlow` — flow shift，ACE-Step 官方建議 `3`，別動。\n\n缺檔案請看「⓪ 缺模型？」那張便條。\n\n---\n\n**English**\n\nOne all-in-one checkpoint (`ace_step_1.5_turbo_aio`, 10.03 GB) carries the diffusion model, text encoder and VAE; `ModelSamplingAuraFlow` stays at the official shift of 3. See the \"⓪ Missing models?\" note if the file is missing."
      ],
      "title": "① 模型載入器 / Model loader"
    },
    {
      "id": 102,
      "type": "MarkdownNote",
      "pos": [
        900,
        1300
      ],
      "size": [
        760,
        460
      ],
      "flags": {},
      "order": 20,
      "mode": 0,
      "inputs": [],
      "outputs": [],
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "**繁體中文 — 紅框三顆就是全部要改的**\n\n- **音樂想法**：中文一句話（曲風＋氛圍＋樂器＋人聲）。本機的 Qwen3-VL-4B Heretic（無審查版）會把它寫成英文風格描述，自動接進右邊的 `tags`——露骨主題也照寫，不會被拒絕。\n- **歌詞**：直接寫中文，段落標記（`[Intro]`、`[Verse]`、`[Chorus]`、`[Bridge]`、`[Outro]`）留著，模型會照段落編曲；清空只留 `[Intro]` 就是純伴奏。\n- **歌曲長度**：秒數，同時控制編曲與音訊長度，兩邊已經接好，改這一顆就夠。\n\n想自己直接寫英文 tags：把 `TextEncodeAceStepAudio1.5` 的 `tags` 輸入線拔掉，欄位就會變回可以手打。\n\n---\n\n**English — the three red nodes are all you edit**\n\nThe idea node feeds the uncensored local Qwen3-VL-4B Heretic, which writes the English style tags into `tags`; the lyrics node is wired into `lyrics` (keep the `[Verse]`-style section markers, clear them for an instrumental); the seconds knob drives both the conditioning duration and the latent length. To write the English tags yourself, unplug the `tags` input."
      ],
      "title": "② 想法 → 風格與歌詞 / Idea → style & lyrics"
    },
    {
      "id": 103,
      "type": "MarkdownNote",
      "pos": [
        2320,
        480
      ],
      "size": [
        660,
        460
      ],
      "flags": {},
      "order": 21,
      "mode": 0,
      "inputs": [],
      "outputs": [],
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "**繁體中文 — 這一區什麼時候要動**\n\n- `TextEncodeAceStepAudio1.5`：`language` 預設 `zh`（中文歌詞）；`bpm` 預設 100、調性 `C major`，想要快歌／別的調自己改。`generate_audio_codes` 開著品質較好、關掉比較快。\n- `EmptyAceStep1.5LatentAudio` 的秒數由紅框那顆「歌曲長度」接入，不用動這裡。\n- `KSampler`：turbo 版 `steps 8`、`cfg 1`、`euler / simple` 是官方建議值，別動。\n- 種子統一由「種子」節點控制，預設每次隨機（連小幫手寫的風格描述也會跟著變）；想重現同一首就把那顆節點改成 `fixed`。\n\n---\n\n**English — when to touch this section**\n\n`language` defaults to `zh`; adjust `bpm` / key as you like, and leave `steps 8, cfg 1, euler/simple` alone (the official turbo settings). `generate_audio_codes` on = better quality, off = faster. The seconds knob feeds the latent length automatically. One shared seed node drives the sampler, the encoder and the helper; set it to `fixed` to reproduce a song."
      ],
      "title": "③ 音樂條件與取樣 / Conditioning & sampler"
    },
    {
      "id": 104,
      "type": "MarkdownNote",
      "pos": [
        2660,
