      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "**繁體中文 — 輸出在哪裡看**\n\n`SaveAudioMP3` 是輸出節點。按下右上角的 **Run / Queue** 之後：\n\n1. 這張工作流會送到聯邦裡有模型、有空的 worker 執行。\n2. 跑完的歌直接顯示在節點上，可以播放試聽。\n3. MP3 同時存進主控台的「工作」頁，隨時可以回去下載。\n\n---\n\n**English — where the output lands**\n\nPress **Run**: the job is dispatched to an idle worker with the model, the finished song shows up on the `SaveAudioMP3` node with a player, and the MP3 is kept under the console's Jobs page."
      ],
      "title": "④ 輸出 / Output"
    },
